sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor BM as Band Member
    participant UI as WebClient
    participant API as ReleaseController
    participant RS as ReleaseService
    participant BR as BandRepository
    participant GR as GenreRepository
    participant RP as ReleaseRepository
    participant NS as NotificationService
    Note over BM,NS: Scenario 6 - Band creates a valid Release
    BM->>UI: submitRelease(details, genreId)
    activate UI
    UI->>API: POST /bands/{id}/releases
    activate API
    API->>RS: createRelease(bandId, details, genreId)
    activate RS
    RS->>BR: findById(bandId)
    activate BR
    BR-->>RS: Band
    deactivate BR
    RS->>GR: findById(genreId)
    activate GR
    GR-->>RS: Genre
    deactivate GR
    RS->>RS: validateReleaseDetails(details)
    RS->>RP: save(Release(band_id, genre_id, details))
    activate RP
    RP-->>RS: Release(id)
    deactivate RP
    opt release publication notification is configured
        RS->>NS: notifyReleasePublished(releaseId, bandId)
        activate NS
        NS-->>RS: notificationResult
        deactivate NS
    end
    RS-->>API: ReleaseCreated(release)
    API-->>UI: 201 Created
    UI-->>BM: showRelease(release)
    deactivate RS
    deactivate API
    deactivate UI